# Store every file exactly as it is on disk.
#
# Not the usual `text=auto`. This project has already lost an afternoon to line
# endings once: a run of edits doubled CRLF into \r\r\n across the plugin and
# left several hundred spurious blank lines, and the PHP file still carries
# real newlines inside a few double-quoted strings where they are deliberate.
# Letting Git normalise on checkin and denormalise on checkout would rewrite
# those bytes on every clone. The plugin is CRLF, some assets are LF, and both
# should survive a round trip untouched.
* -text
